{"3430740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pine Creek", "steam_appid": 3430740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/63b3438a80d990fcc05d2e99f6d1f5be.avif?t=1785774386\" width=1300 height=374 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pine Creek is a <strong>story-driven, first-person   horror game</strong> that blends the tense gameplay of <strong>modern stealth horror</strong> with the <strong>eerie</strong> <strong>atmosphere of classic survival horror</strong>, featuring an <strong>authentic ’80s setting</strong>, immersive cinematics, and <strong>environmental puzzles that change with every playthrough</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, first-person survival horror </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth gameplay with hiding mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized puzzles that shift with every playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic '80s small-town atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive cinematics &amp; professional voice acting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPIRED BY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Survival Horror: <i>Alien: Isolation, Resident Evil</i>, Outlast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >’80s Small-Town Mysteries: <i>Stranger Things</i>, <i>Close Encounters of the Third Kind</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic UFO Mysteries: <i>The X-Files</i>, <i>Signs</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.poster.avif?t=1785774386\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.webm?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.mp4?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE PINE CREEK &amp; MANAGE RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unsettling outskirts of Pine Creek, scavenging for resources and key items while avoiding the extraterrestrial entities that roam the area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES &amp; OVERCOME CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way forward is never easy. Solve authentic 80s-inspired environmental puzzles reminiscent of classic survival horror titles — and look out for hidden documents and environmental clues if you find yourself stuck. Puzzle solutions change with every playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY UNDETECTED &amp; EVADE THE GRAYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet, stay hidden, and remain completely undetected. Any physical contact with the alien entities means an instant, brutal abduction. Use distraction items to slow them down — and run when you have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.poster.avif?t=1785774386\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.webm?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.mp4?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an autumn weekend in 1986, you and your wife, Sarah, travel to the Appalachian Mountains of Pennsylvania—home to the small town of Pine Creek, where she grew up. As you approach the town,<strong> a radio broadcast reports a series of mysterious disappearances spanning decades.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, strange things begin to happen. Sarah's uncle arrives, urging you to follow him to his farm. <strong>When you return to your cabin, Sarah is gone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the night, you follow the faint signal from Sarah’s pager, trying to find her across the outskirts of Pine Creek — from dark forests and abandoned facilities to forgotten mines beneath the mountains. Strange lights in the sky. <strong>Gray aliens that stalk and attempt to abduct you.</strong> Characters who may help or hinder your search. And as their secrets unravel, the truth behind Pine Creek’s dark past is finally revealed — and it’s darker than anything you imagined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST PINE CREEK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Pine Creek sounds like your kind of nightmare, wishlist and follow for updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pine Creek is a <strong>story-driven, first-person   horror game</strong> that blends the tense gameplay of <strong>modern stealth horror</strong> with the <strong>eerie</strong> <strong>atmosphere of classic survival horror</strong>, featuring an <strong>authentic ’80s setting</strong>, immersive cinematics, and <strong>environmental puzzles that change with every playthrough</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, first-person survival horror </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth gameplay with hiding mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized puzzles that shift with every playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic '80s small-town atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive cinematics &amp; professional voice acting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPIRED BY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Survival Horror: <i>Alien: Isolation, Resident Evil</i>, Outlast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >’80s Small-Town Mysteries: <i>Stranger Things</i>, <i>Close Encounters of the Third Kind</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic UFO Mysteries: <i>The X-Files</i>, <i>Signs</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.poster.avif?t=1785774386\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.webm?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/d72af9f2e710959f081b8bf93760f067.mp4?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE PINE CREEK &amp; MANAGE RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unsettling outskirts of Pine Creek, scavenging for resources and key items while avoiding the extraterrestrial entities that roam the area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES &amp; OVERCOME CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way forward is never easy. Solve authentic 80s-inspired environmental puzzles reminiscent of classic survival horror titles — and look out for hidden documents and environmental clues if you find yourself stuck. Puzzle solutions change with every playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY UNDETECTED &amp; EVADE THE GRAYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet, stay hidden, and remain completely undetected. Any physical contact with the alien entities means an instant, brutal abduction. Use distraction items to slow them down — and run when you have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.poster.avif?t=1785774386\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.webm?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/extras/bb850683a1a37144c4352c832ca9dc3c.mp4?t=1785774386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an autumn weekend in 1986, you and your wife, Sarah, travel to the Appalachian Mountains of Pennsylvania—home to the small town of Pine Creek, where she grew up. As you approach the town,<strong> a radio broadcast reports a series of mysterious disappearances spanning decades.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, strange things begin to happen. Sarah's uncle arrives, urging you to follow him to his farm. <strong>When you return to your cabin, Sarah is gone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the night, you follow the faint signal from Sarah’s pager, trying to find her across the outskirts of Pine Creek — from dark forests and abandoned facilities to forgotten mines beneath the mountains. Strange lights in the sky. <strong>Gray aliens that stalk and attempt to abduct you.</strong> Characters who may help or hinder your search. And as their secrets unravel, the truth behind Pine Creek’s dark past is finally revealed — and it’s darker than anything you imagined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST PINE CREEK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Pine Creek sounds like your kind of nightmare, wishlist and follow for updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more.</p>", "short_description": "A weekend getaway to Pine Creek in '86 turns into a nightmare when your wife vanishes as strange lights appear in the sky. Solve puzzles, hide from the grays, save Sarah and survive the night in this first-person stealth survival horror. The truth is darker than you think.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/049b247300bf3f0d99e4de9f40474b6ca173393d/header.jpg?t=1785774386", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/12e166065910fc2119e83ce2f3d38ef7f6fb49b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785774386", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430740/12e166065910fc2119e83ce2f3d38ef7f6fb49b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785774386", "website": "https://www.dreadmith.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5 or AMD Ryzen™ 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon™ RX 480<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® 2080RTX or AMD Radeon™ 6800XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "m